{"time": 1765440259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783837120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(变成类人)"}
{"time": 1765440277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932641312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（到时候，小卡做家族首领，小格做副首领，我就做个先锋龙（bushi））"}
{"time": 1765440373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061374993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不管他。\"抱着梅梅，\"我好像一口气喝多了....梅梅变成人啦...\""}
{"time": 1765440458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357221304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"哎？小卡还真是不省心啊\"梅梅从你怀里飞出来到地上，随后一闪，变成了一个小女孩的模样，搀扶着你“下次别喝啦...”"}
{"time": 1765440547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245022009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"做事就要随心所欲嘛...\"靠着她，\"至于，后果...做了再想。\"做好明天出发的准备。"}
{"time": 1765440584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "278992560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这幅场景自然也被其他人看到了，露出了一些不怀好意的目光，不过也没人想第一个动手"}
{"time": 1765440788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755932692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "环视周围的目光，事到如今，只是杀人而已的事情，冷哼一声，离开。"}
{"time": 1765440802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932075065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，我突然觉得点食人鱼打击不如点业余宿敌)"}
{"time": 1765440810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448028258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(该破敌类人了)"}
{"time": 1765440862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144970676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到你的眼神更没人想第一个出手了，到最后反而没有一个追出来，毕竟在这里的大部分都是社会的底层中的底层，满脑子都是自己"}
{"time": 1765440965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255101016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=5956305D447287A043EA528B3C9BC374.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQdlyqcKYY0sG13G0qIFF1ssaOczhiZ6gUg_woot6WAjIy1kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQZlXiodnzp7tYvQaTfCEsxnoCZW-CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMFbnRUufjv1VgomZvTbat1CsNsxL0og7dV0-H3VqNOyaQiiF_qSHzVH6VMOjSJjSJQ,file_size=95513]"}
{"time": 1765441009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513161320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(确实，换成业余宿敌了)"}
{"time": 1765441028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765988200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人类？）"}
{"time": 1765441043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065420495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着梅梅回下榻的地方，第二天就该出发了。"}
{"time": 1765441046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072072483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(类人)"}
