{"time": 1765446415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809846711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过感觉算起来好麻烦）"}
{"time": 1765446600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388020341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有，你花专长点就是"}
{"time": 1765449756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809103103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(几时)"}
{"time": 1765449779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "37199800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（现在吧）"}
{"time": 1765449786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093320915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我收拾一下，准备出门）"}
{"time": 1765450152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656636620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1043794412]又过了几个小时，差不多在一天最热的时候，马车逐渐慢了下来"}
{"time": 1765450246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025498857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1252219916]"}
{"time": 1765450257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835728944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1765450285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474510779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 你吃完午饭又休息了一会，差不多已经到了和西姆莉约定的时间"}
{"time": 1765450297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098216898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "去酒馆"}
{"time": 1765450313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780170499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "剑履上殿（）"}
{"time": 1765450385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819208533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=656636620]被震感慢慢激醒，揉揉眼睛，看看梅梅。"}
{"time": 1765450422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030985275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=819208533][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 梅梅还在睡，嘴角甚至有些口水"}
{"time": 1765450491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1121696325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1098216898][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 酒馆离你家不是很远 自然很快就到了，酒馆名字叫破釜沉舟，这个点倒是没什么人的样子，至于西姆莉也没有来，距离约定的时间还差一段时间"}
{"time": 1765450576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447177975", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "───────────────────────\r\n五顏六色的木盾和飽經風霜的鹿角懸掛在\r\n這個鄉村酒館的牆壁上。頭頂上有一塊城垛形\r\n狀的招牌上面寫著「破釜沉舟酒館」——其中\r\n的橫豎筆畫被替換成了綠色箭矢。"}
{"time": 1765450589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359572823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2030985275]\"哼哼?\"帮她擦一擦口水，掀开帘子看看"}
{"time": 1765450590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123285561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "五顏六色的木盾和飽經風霜的鹿角懸掛在\r\n這個鄉村酒館的牆壁上。頭頂上有一塊城垛形\r\n狀的招牌上面寫著「破釜沉舟酒館」——其中\r\n的橫豎筆畫被替換成了綠色箭矢"}
{"time": 1765450619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400225923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1359572823][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 已经基本到了镇子上，不过离驿站还有一些距离"}
{"time": 1765450686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417896181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这里看起来没有什么生气的样子，房子看起来也都比较久远"}
{"time": 1765450707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101884961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "给人一种垂垂老矣的感觉"}
{"time": 1765450730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081881038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "推门而入，看看屋内有多少人"}
{"time": 1765450789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961734136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深深打个哈欠，这破地就是对我来说的机遇?咂咂嘴，调整一下表情，把靠在自己身上的梅梅摇醒，\"小瞌睡虫，到了。\""}
{"time": 1765450795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174596391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2081881038][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 除去老板之外，几乎没有其他的人了，感觉就算在光明正大的地方密谋，也不会刷新出窃听的人"}
{"time": 1765450834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039793672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（错的，有人在旁边才不会被窃听）"}
{"time": 1765450841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571264482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=961734136][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “呜呜....”揉揉眼睛“到...到了吗...”她拍了拍自己的脸努力去清醒过来"}
{"time": 1765450885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917341961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就找个座位坐下等西姆莉"}
{"time": 1765450901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374654367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2039793672][CQ:at,qq=825734198] (两个人独处必被窃听)"}
{"time": 1765450925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18119313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "(两个人独处必被窃听)"}
{"time": 1765450960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059870742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到了啦。\"说起来那家伙让自己过来找一个叫西姆莉的人，\"啧，那个西姆莉到底在哪?\""}
{"time": 1765450965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043288405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=917341961][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 老板兼厨子卡特看你好像也没点东西的样子，有点生气，但看清是你后，也没有说些什么，继续坐在柜台发呆"}
{"time": 1765451007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669855318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个镇子看着也不是很大的样子，招个人应该...啊啊啊...蛮容易的吧”打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1765451023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649350766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "依然发呆，等两点整"}
{"time": 1765451049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181688040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"话是这么说啦。\"皱着眉头，深呼吸，压住自己的无名火，\"梅梅，我先带你去吃饭吧。\""}
{"time": 1765451078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468073854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小卡最好了...我现在饿的可以吃下好几座山”"}
{"time": 1765451122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901776133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "她专门用手比划了一下，看起来真的很饿"}
{"time": 1765451137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224957595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "过了一会，马车彻底停了下来“客人，到了”"}
{"time": 1765451141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421192210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摸摸脑袋，敲敲车厢，\"车夫，送到最近的饭店。\"语气不算好，有些冲。"}
{"time": 1765451155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931611920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "马夫的声音从前面传来"}
{"time": 1765451210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465492167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？还要加班，那你加点钱吧”车夫的声音听着也有些慵懒"}
{"time": 1765451219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760960547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点符合这座城镇的特色"}
{"time": 1765451278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461245452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=421192210][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 梅梅乖巧的靠着你，享受被你摸头"}
{"time": 1765451379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440683410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到了自然少不了你好处。\"一只手还在摸摸脑袋，另一只手的手指挪到自己的匕首上。"}
{"time": 1765451431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589222960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行吧行吧...”马车又重新缓缓动了起来，车夫似乎小声说了什么"}
{"time": 1765451471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868161924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但这时候你忽然听到马车外似乎传来声音“别走啊，怎么要走了，车里的是卡缇希亚吗”"}
{"time": 1765451606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588935669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "警觉起来，这种地方怎么可能有人认识自己。对着梅梅比了一个噤声的手势，伏下腰握住匕首，如果那人敢靠近车厢，自己就直接出手。"}
{"time": 1765451715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082803786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以是吗，怎么不回话啊..真是的”外面传来抱怨的声音"}
{"time": 1765451774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089336165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己靠近一点门边，等待。"}
{"time": 1765451913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193210528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个样式的，就是老大说的啊”女声带着疑惑加一点生气“敢不理我，整个长野你是第一个，停车！”车夫听了她的话 也缓缓把车停下"}
{"time": 1765451996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924108197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你不会是哑巴吧”"}
{"time": 1765452003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063285657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看了一眼我的技能，并没有察觉）"}
{"time": 1765452015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573643937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然，送三个本职？）"}
{"time": 1765452028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905607145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对方啧了一声，就离开了"}
{"time": 1765452043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891588148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "马车又慢慢动了起来"}
