{"time": 1765453572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676103496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哟呵，有点意思……犯什么事了？”走到西姆莉旁边"}
{"time": 1765453580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087058098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉一群人围上来给我一人一刀，我是卡卡西，中了月读。)"}
{"time": 1765453609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221124089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1537800852](所以就是没料到嘛，以为她只有一个人)"}
{"time": 1765453639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977439777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=69301723]（我觉得这个时候还有跑的空间（））"}
{"time": 1765453652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570294294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这人纯纯有病，上来就想打匕首捅我，我估计她大概率就是本来晚上要和你一起行动的家伙”西姆莉收回了长剑，从手下那拿了两根绳子把二人绑了起来"}
{"time": 1765453681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330296375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太暴躁了，晚上还是就咱俩去吧”"}
{"time": 1765453756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35201125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那胆子很大了”有点忍俊不禁“就是好像没什么眼力见。我是都行，之后怎么处置她？”"}
{"time": 1765453814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871282606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们先把她送监狱关起来吧，按照律法的话，她可能会被当街处刑”"}
{"time": 1765453974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682127334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（太那啥了，我不知道怎么进行下去了，先缓缓）"}
