{"time": 1765461089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910529302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之打6）"}
{"time": 1765461093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403392852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "挨了剑鞘一下，皱着眉后退，“你没说过要用剑。”死死盯着她和自己有些相似的面容，身体挡在梅梅身前，“作弊...”咬牙切齿"}
{"time": 1765461182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294065551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有剑为什么不用，你要是有匕首还会用筷子？”嗓音沙哑了许多，捂着喉咙不住咳嗽“倒确实还行”"}
{"time": 1765461279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458546473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（匕首就在桌上，为什么不用，是不想吗（）"}
{"time": 1765461288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493993120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "正当你们打斗完，门也打开了，拎着饭的西姆莉看到你们的样子“怎么了，发生什么事了”"}
{"time": 1765461380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549710910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”这个家伙也回来了，警惕地看着两人，抱着梅梅退到边角。"}
{"time": 1765461386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162067573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“面试……咳咳”直起身来“身手还行，晚上要去偷东西的话就能确实能带上她，不过。”"}
{"time": 1765461422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531245007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大概没有忠诚可言，总得留下拿走什么押着才算能用吧”"}
{"time": 1765461472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379199770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“麻烦你了，不过你们两个伤的挺重的样子”随后她收起桌子上的匕首，然后掏出两张卷轴，嘴里念叨着什么"}
{"time": 1765461496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889507893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“从你两的工钱里扣”卷轴发出金光，你们发现自己身上的伤居然好了"}
{"time": 1765461512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399877251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她不是还有个同伴么，把她留下来怎么样”"}
{"time": 1765461535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005487981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我就这么想的”"}
{"time": 1765461551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348804285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后回来一看，脱困指令跑了）"}
{"time": 1765461559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18176967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（银龙应该不需要魔法书？）"}
{"time": 1765461580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145251535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行...\"紧紧靠着墙壁，\"她要和我一起。\""}
{"time": 1765461617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "399871097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“死一起也算一起”幽幽地提醒道"}
{"time": 1765461626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637155914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但其实也无所谓...她如果想跑的话，也不会来这里了”把饭放到桌子上"}
{"time": 1765461647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004282037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这家伙在说什么呢）"}
{"time": 1765461657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182194248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他有的选吗）"}
{"time": 1765461664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1185289460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得你应该不是那种甘愿一辈子只能小偷小摸吧”"}
{"time": 1765461671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109668081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "的人"}
{"time": 1765461699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319422786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1182194248]（hh）"}
{"time": 1765461705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "483054272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我的意思是来长野）"}
{"time": 1765461754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826285461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“来吃吧...我顺便讲一下晚上的行动”"}
{"time": 1765461774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212542283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（疑似有点善了）"}
{"time": 1765461814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485638868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（俗话说打一棒子还得给个甜枣呢）"}
{"time": 1765461824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910665098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（现在是甜枣环节）"}
{"time": 1765461872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445290776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（治疗术不就是了（）"}
{"time": 1765461945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944494829", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡提西亚不在，我就在重复一下我们今晚的行动内容，受一位大人物所托，我们要去抢劫罗斯里克皮革厂，事成之后，他会给我们每人100金币，当然，你们两个一人都只有70,30要还我的卷轴钱”"}
{"time": 1765461964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379246417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扫一眼眼前两人，收回视线，深呼吸，摇一摇梅丹佐。"}
{"time": 1765461965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415378005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“卡提西亚之前不在，我就再重复一下我们今晚的行动内容，受一位大人物所托，我们要去抢劫罗斯里克皮革厂，事成之后，他会给我们每人100金币，当然，你们两个一人都只有70,30要还我的卷轴钱”"}
{"time": 1765462006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510945805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呜呜呜...”梅丹佐很快也醒来了，揉揉自己之前被打的位置，环绕四周“这是哪...”"}
{"time": 1765462028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869515287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“皮革厂有什么好抢的，总不能真的是为了钱”"}
{"time": 1765462127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1515600189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "西姆莉没有管你的小动作“罗斯里克并不是一个守法公民，他常年偷税漏税，所以那位大人想让我们去把税款给取回来，取得越多，报酬越多，而且钱只是其次”"}
{"time": 1765462143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108938959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"别怕别怕...\"抱着她，听着前面两人的对话。心里默默向梅丹佐传递暂且安心的情绪。"}
{"time": 1765462157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299146730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，居然只是情感链接，不是心灵通话)"}
{"time": 1765462180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192794843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”她点点头，小声说道“只要和小卡在一起，怎样就好”"}
{"time": 1765462198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717914445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好腻歪的一对公婆）"}
{"time": 1765462215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091314504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1515600189]她故意卖了个关子，没有继续说下去"}
{"time": 1765462266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885885541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以更重要的是？有宝物？”"}
{"time": 1765462360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745247119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在一旁没有开口，帮着梅梅处理被打的淤青。默默听着。"}
{"time": 1765462410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585832750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“事成之后，我会把你们引荐给这次的雇主，拉泽拉戈大人，那位大人可不是一般人”"}
{"time": 1765462501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45891212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，这还有点意思，那位大人是哪个派系的？”"}
{"time": 1765462577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095986124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“他特别有前钱，而且路子很硬，最重要的是他和长野镇政府的大男爵大人也有一定的交情，所以你觉得呢，格蕾西亚，你不是一直很崇拜特鲁恩家族么，这可是个机会...”"}
{"time": 1765462610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258621726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，这次确实谢谢你能找到这么个机会了”"}
{"time": 1765462610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309489982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=8B467C8B5E59DBB841BD20373912AD45.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRyK3dCfrp6C1sXXsARCo4fS-7oHBi8wBAg_wool9Wb3dy1kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQek3TgvjRycrqGxTeeWBnbHoCnoOCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMGSAAcl6eV9OzDDRcIiRtzxmxc78LhDZ4XqLB-1nhWalQUZlCmCqaOcyBudTnb8-fw,file_size=270396]"}
{"time": 1765462706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "630434022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"崇拜特鲁恩家族...\"小声重复了一边，虽然自己的金主也是对方就是了。"}
{"time": 1765462799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425261861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那，那个皮革厂晚上有多少人在？有地图么？”"}
{"time": 1765462871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734322872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“会有几个夜班工人，不过主要是有几条烦人的狗，罗斯里克本人当然也在，值钱的东西基本都在他的周围”"}
{"time": 1765462900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696153433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=87B209E8159E10653A2B9DF5B2ED0439.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR-be2BlhLgn-V0FyErc4cp1gBqTBiO3lcg_woop7Hu5t21kQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQqCHSbUDavKpuq14z7NLryHoC0HCCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMGSAAcl6eV9OzDDRcIiRtzxmxc78LhDZ4XqLB-1nhWalQUZlCmCqaOcyBudTnb8-fw,file_size=1437454]“地图的话，我也带过来了，你们看看吧”"}
{"time": 1765462936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "627521025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“a4就是他办公室的所在地”"}
{"time": 1765462943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297829596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "远远看一眼，\"...不杀人?\""}
{"time": 1765462998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848415606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看情况行事，如果事情会闹到不可收拾的程度，也可以杀人”"}
{"time": 1765463160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901826100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“达成目标是第一要务...”"}
{"time": 1765463185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208309341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“最后，我要提醒一下....”她忽然收起之前嘻嘻哈哈的样子，表情严肃的看着你们"}
{"time": 1765463266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518659167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（讲）"}
{"time": 1765463351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051063923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果我们需要分头跑路的话，就在灰屋集合，但如果谁被抓到了，只要什么都不说，我就有办法把她弄出来，但如果但凡多说了一个字，那就准备一辈子都烂在牢里”短暂的停顿了一下，她又恢复常见的笑脸“还有什么其他的疑问吗”"}
{"time": 1765463516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121880422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...无所谓...\"闭了闭眼，\"能杀人就行。\""}
{"time": 1765463546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634689895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“小姑娘还真是暴躁啊”"}
{"time": 1765463859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2000184164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"对这个话有些不置可否，\"反正，我对除了这种事之外，也没什么很有感兴趣的事了。\""}
{"time": 1765464011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494056922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“格蕾西亚呢，你还有什么疑问吗”"}
