{"time": 1765469412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239277329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以...希望今晚一切顺利，所以暴躁的小姑娘，你不饿吗”梅梅看着桌子的食物咽了咽口水，抬头征求卡提西亚的意见"}
{"time": 1765469422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443680105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是梅梅，和格格）"}
{"time": 1765469478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237894306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（格格是？）"}
