{"time": 1765471203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130377521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883251164]“……行吧，反正我要是死了你就给我收尸”"}
{"time": 1765471240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037082236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之，房子的事情之后再说吧”"}
{"time": 1765471254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636735113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行动之前你们还有什么要做的事情吗”"}
{"time": 1765471276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "500946008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要问你）"}
{"time": 1765471286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425544823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“镇上最近还有什么别的事吗？”"}
{"time": 1765471286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991773372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有了。\"一边吃饭，一边等着"}
{"time": 1765471483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402329742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一些杂种被某些路边势力激励，在计划一些事情，这算特殊的事吗，其实以前都还好，最多停留在口嗨，但最近那个骑士团的事情出来之后，感觉有点不太一般了....”"}
{"time": 1765471586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889818059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那骑士团影响力这么大？”"}
{"time": 1765471931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2009490619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你也知道的本来我们长野就不是很稳定，这里很多老兵都是信仰艾奥梅黛的，镇上也有艾奥梅黛的教堂，听说那些大城市都采取了军事管制，而且最主要的是，那群家伙已经从神爪骑士团手中夺得了心之刃，一些不太安分的人，心里不安分的念头就被勾动了”西姆莉对此有些不屑“艾奥梅黛有什么好的”"}
{"time": 1765471979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959740596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "心之刃据传是艾奥梅黛的佩剑"}
{"time": 1765472002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912315462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟是那个女神的？\"打个哈欠，\"反正...跟我没关系，这种家伙只会拦着我面圣苍姬。\""}
{"time": 1765472052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687125765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听起来敌人不少啊”"}
{"time": 1765472120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50657674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看起来你不是本国人？阿斯莫蒂斯教可是国教，劝你还是不要随便就提及你的信仰”"}
{"time": 1765472200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859679484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我?我当然是本国人。\"伸个懒腰，\"但是比起那种无聊的领主，还是苍姬大人更好吧?\""}
{"time": 1765472361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283228524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"你是本国人还敢这样？‘’对方的眼神有些吃惊“你不知道黑暗王子对我们的三重赐福吗？以后不要说这种亵渎的话了”"}
{"time": 1765472409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609785164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙神是外地人是吧[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 那你可以过个知识宗教）"}
