{"time": 1765472515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636315310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1283228524]\"那怎么了?\"拍拍梅梅的脑袋，\"反正...你知道的，这么久也没人管过我。\""}
{"time": 1765472527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1662833919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=216858241](给我整无语了)"}
{"time": 1765473587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934729550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没活了）"}
{"time": 1765473636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994284407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1636315310]“黑暗王子赐我们三层祝福，你不信的话，死后可不能魂归地狱了”"}
{"time": 1765473726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088676082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"什么魂归地狱。\"皱了皱眉，\"九狱接引对象还要看信仰吗？\""}
{"time": 1765473758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557688311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我对死后魂归哪其实……算了，就当我信”*耸耸肩“我对死后的事情不太关注，还是眼前的事比较重要”"}
{"time": 1765474404, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952366829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“镇上有哪些特别不安分的人吗？要不要先敲打敲打”"}
{"time": 1765474443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085176483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“毕竟没有黑暗王子就没有现在的切利亚斯么，祂不仅帮伟大的特鲁恩家族获得统治权，还维护了切利亚斯的稳定，甚至祂亲自指引了切利亚斯所有的群众，只要信仰，死后灵魂便会到阿斯莫蒂斯大人那里”"}
{"time": 1765474453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585656807", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骗你的，不信也会到）"}
{"time": 1765474458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482688954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1765474474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438285039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骗你的，不信也会到，但可能会更惨吧）"}
{"time": 1765474487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392436428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实是本国人的灵魂都被卖给恶魔了）"}
{"time": 1765474501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848005782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我只是不信灵魂会去哪）"}
{"time": 1765474512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083569939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你为什么不信，你都信魔鬼了）"}
{"time": 1765474513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796680852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是不信奥斯曼狄斯（）"}
{"time": 1765474524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946530400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（灵魂除了去九狱还能去哪）"}
{"time": 1765474526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "355795295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不如说其实是不关心）"}
{"time": 1765474535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975516621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（灵魂只是魔鬼手中的货币）"}
{"time": 1765474650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143860732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=952366829][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “这个你目前不用操心，先处理好今晚的事情”"}
{"time": 1765474694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484233374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2085176483]“那倒是...”当然自己对这一切漠不关心，“反正，就像魔鬼会取走信者的灵魂，苍姬女士也会收走我的吧。” 站起身，“我现在只关心，什么时候能杀人。”"}
{"time": 1765474709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652626149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行，要是让我知道他偷的税流向了艾奥梅黛所属，我可要先斩后奏了”"}
{"time": 1765474998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124594999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那就晚上再见了，直接皮革厂集合？”"}
{"time": 1765475013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63069783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...晚上见！”"}
{"time": 1765475112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320277301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（走了？）"}
{"time": 1765475176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514207471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后西姆莉变离开了房子，留你们二人一龙独处“你们可要好好相处啊，提前互相熟悉熟悉”"}
{"time": 1765475225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329862283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "等她出门后对门竖个中指“又把烂摊子丢给我，哎”"}
{"time": 1765475283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121050723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*坐回沙发上，翘着腿看着不速之客“你呢，怎么老想着杀人？”"}
{"time": 1765475395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553543577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呵呵，我可是记住了。\"比了个相同的手势，自顾自坐在餐桌边，对着一边的人翻个白眼，\"怎么?不能干?\""}
{"time": 1765475474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373616320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那打算什么时候杀我？”瞥她一眼，手放在刀柄上"}
{"time": 1765475478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759327485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅很快便吃完了属于她的那份，满意的捂着自己的小肚子“怎么，不能干？”学着她的主人，对格蕾西亚比出了相同的手势"}
{"time": 1765475592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308499503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "瞥一眼自己的匕首落在哪了，装作不经意地开口，\"你这么想死?\"眼珠子转一圈，\"我现在就能杀了你。\""}
{"time": 1765475681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333693597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1308499503]（插在桌上呢）"}
{"time": 1765475758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990540314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就该强硬点把你丢给西姆莉那去”*翻个白眼“不打算动手就去睡觉”"}
{"time": 1765475859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008237055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行。\"把桌上的匕首收回鞘里，吸口气，\"我问你，你老实回答。\"语气一本正经，\"你怎么长得像我?\"向梅梅传达这样的疑问，示意她一起发问。"}
{"time": 1765475945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362528520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你为什么长得和小卡这么像”"}
{"time": 1765475962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831066224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "梅梅有样学样的学着卡缇希亚"}
